            "description": "### Purpose\n\nConfirms Identity's password policy is enforced and returns specific,  \nactionable error messages — not a generic \"invalid input\" response.\n\n### Expected Response\n\n`400 Bad Request`\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"errors\": [\n    \"Passwords must be at least 6 characters.\",\n    \"Passwords must have at least one non alphanumeric character.\",\n    \"Passwords must have at least one lowercase ('a'-'z').\",\n    \"Passwords must have at least one uppercase ('A'-'Z').\"\n  ]\n}\n\n ```"
